PNG-SPEC v1.2 HIGH-FIDELITY
Canvas: 2400x1600 px
Background: Transparent (#00000000)
Stroke: 4px Black (#000000FF)
Font: Inter-SemiBold 32px White (#FFFFFFFF)
Grid: 100px major, 20px minor, 20% opacity

Layers:
  L0: Coordinate Frame
  L1: Manifold Patch
    - Same geometry as F1–F4 for continuity
  L2: Eigenfunction Visualization
    - Heatmap-style contour lines (monochrome)
    - Contours: 4px stroke, grayscale (#FFFFFFAA → #000000AA)
  L3: Eigenfunction Peaks/Troughs
    - Peaks marked with small white circles
    - Troughs marked with small black circles
  L4: Labels
    - "Eigenfunction φ_k"
    - "Δφ_k = λ_k φ_k"
  L5: Annotation Overlay
    - λ_k displayed near contour set

Export:
  PNG (RGBA), sRGB, no compression artifacts
